    "description": "Super 100s, Super 150s: the number on a suit label looks like a grade. Under the IWTO rule, it only gives an upper limit for the mean fibre diameter of the wool. On the cutting table you see what the number fixes and what it doesn't.",
    "companion_text": "Suitwerk shows menswear in detail, drawn rather than claimed. No advertising, no product recommendation.",
